# Components

## Folders
`layout/` · `ui/` · `sections/` · `content/` · `seo/` · `studio/`

Route-private UI: `app/(site)/**/_components/` — never imported elsewhere  
(e.g. `contact/_components/ContactForm.tsx`, `*LeafPage.tsx`)

## Shared building blocks (prefer these)

| Need | Component |
|------|-----------|
| Public page hero | `ui/PageHeroHeader` |
| Dark course/service hero | `content/LeafHero` |
| Homepage title + view-all | `ui/SectionHeaderRow` |
| Centered section H2 | `ui/CenteredSectionHeader` |
| Listing index shell | `layout/ListingIndexShell` (+ `ListingCardGrid` / `ListingEmptyState`) |
| Nested CMS children | `content/NestedChildListing` |
| Content cards | `ui/ContentCard` — **one** primary `<Link>` (no double tab stops) |
| Portable Text | `content/RichTextBody` (`TW_RICH_TEXT_*`) |
| Leaf FAQ / steps / CTA | `FaqAccordion` · `HowItWorksSection` · `LeafCtaBanner` |
| Contact form | route-private `ContactForm` + `ui/TurnstileField` |

## Patterns
- Server Components default; `"use client"` only for state/effects/browser APIs
- React Compiler on — **no** default `useMemo` / `useCallback` unless measuring a real issue
- `Header` + lazy `HeaderMobileMenu` (`dynamic`, `ssr: false`)
- Footer: inline SVG in RSC; lucide in client components only
- `role="menuitem"` only inside `role="menu"`
- Images: `next/image` + explicit `sizes`; `loading="lazy"` below fold; LCP exception: hero `<img fetchPriority="high">`
- Pass Sanity data as props; batch layout reads in `requestAnimationFrame`
- Reveal: mobile + reduced-motion + `@media (scripting: none)` keep content visible
- Interactive: `min-h-11` + visible `focus-visible`; forms use `aria-busy` / `aria-live` where status changes

